+
+## Alpha20 lossless scale pipeline
+
+Alpha20 is the first pass after the “big optimisations first” reset. It adds a lossless scale pipeline for ordinary survival servers targeting thousands of players at 20 TPS while preserving the AGC hard rules: no packet drops, no mutable packet sharing, no per-connection packet reorder, no chunk FIFO head skip, no entity tick/AI/damage/interaction skip, no off-thread Bukkit mutation and no plugin event reorder.
+
+The new major runtime pieces are `AGCScale20LosslessPipeline`, `AGCNetworkBackboneGraph`, `AGCChunkWorksetSlicer`, `AGCEntityWitnessIndex`, `AGCWorldSemanticScheduler`, `AGCPluginDeterminismGuard` and `AGCResourcePlacementPlanner`. These are deliberately algorithmic rather than cosmetic: they reserve CPU/memory for primary-thread gameplay, plugins, Netty, GC and OS, then spend remaining capacity only on read-only helper work such as packet backbone planning, FIFO-compatible chunk worksets, entity witness indexing and semantic world-slot planning.
+
+Operator report: `/agc scale20`. Public API: `AGC.performance().scale20Plan(players, targetTps)` and `AGCScale20Plan`.
